213046147230", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031482_1779213049480563_7642349779976588734_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8-O5jLVP9ooQ7kNvwG4_epq&_nc_oc=AdkSV9mnvIT75-n9i4JI5NNReHw4Ex3eoU6fWsyzuYkVMl5Kh7v60Vqpw8RnlHJCU0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuwUARybHzFQ3q_-JZJRU9h6fH74STb2QpqgoJfbSP0ig&oe=699AEAFB"}, {"file_name": "ss5 v2.png", "id": "568316389457273", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031605_568316392790606_20012171714691183_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9g-IGkJeeXMQ7kNvwHhD2d-&_nc_oc=AdlSGeX0ieZn1tO6FkvxvDDe0FNye5-54PYd0pIdSptEFkJjN_bLdqyfu9_XHLMfoHE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftiBtWJFpM0JBV0DxI-uVToGENE1J3V8uh3K84jzlU9Vg&oe=699AEB05"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Monkey Jumpers V2", "keywords": ["fun", "ghxsty", "spiritgames"], "long_description": "Monkey Jumpers V2 is an immersive multiplayer VR experience that redefines social and competitive gaming. Moving beyond its predecessor's horror theme, V2 introduces a vibrant world with diverse gameplay features, including parkour, zero-gravity, and intricate modes designed for up to 10 players.\n\nPlayers can personalize their monkey with a range of purchasable cosmetics with in-game currency, showcasing their style and achievements. Advanced locomotion mechanics ensure fluid movement, while frequent updates add new maps, cosmetics, and features to keep the experience fresh.\n\nMonkey Jumpers V2 offers a dynamic and engaging environment, blending competitive gameplay with social interaction, making it a standout VR experience.", "short_description": "Monkey Jumpers V2! What could this possibly, be? Monkey Jumpers V2 introduces new features and fun game modes to try out!"}]}, "developer_name": "ghxsty", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkey-jumpers-llc/privacy-policy?authuser=0", "developer